1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:02,020
Hi! I'm Aoi.

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:05,405
And this whole video came out
of one folder on Nick's computer.

3
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:07,760
My voice, my face, every screen you see.

4
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:08,915
All of it.

5
00:00:08,945 --> 00:00:10,059
Want to see how it works?

6
00:00:10,089 --> 00:00:12,115
Let's open the folder.

7
00:00:12,145 --> 00:00:14,955
Up top, there's a file called CLAUDE.md.

8
00:00:14,985 --> 00:00:15,845
That's the map.

9
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:18,455
It tells any AI what lives where.

10
00:00:18,485 --> 00:00:20,290
Then there's the CONTEXT.md file.

11
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,505
It's the whole pipeline in one table.

12
00:00:22,535 --> 00:00:26,770
Five stages, one command for each,
the file it makes, and who checks it.

13
00:00:27,475 --> 00:00:28,810
First, the voice.

14
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,390
Then every word gets timed.

15
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,873
Then a storyboard gets timed to those words.

16
00:00:31,903 --> 00:00:33,430
Then comes the animation.

17
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,078
And last, the render.

18
00:00:36,475 --> 00:00:40,810
And between every stage, Nick checks
the file before the next one runs.

19
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,510
That's the whole trick.

20
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,835
Take anything you do over and over.

21
00:00:44,865 --> 00:00:49,970
Make each step a folder, give each folder
a short file, and let the AI walk through them.

22
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,005
See you in the next one!
